*3+1*4+3*4)*r=38*r; twelve quarter-cylinder edge pieces give pi*(1+3+4)*r^2=8*pi*r^2; eight corner octants give (4*pi/3)*r^3. Thus a=4*pi/3,b=8*pi,c=38,d=12 and bc/(ad)=19, B. Preserve the root-approved H decomposition target and exact surface, box, cylinder and sphere volume support. This partition works for every r>=0 and does not overcount overlapping whole cylinders or balls. Actual h112 supplies radius ratios, not the sphere coefficient.","recordedAnswer":"B","status":"matches"},"assessed":false,"bank":"amc","canonicalNodeIds":["cnm_p161"],"coverage":"aligned_concept_only","flags":[],"questionId":"2020_AMC_10B_Q20","reviewStatus":"machine_scope_audited","routes":[{"contextNodeIds":[],"id":"face-edge-corner-decomposition","label":"Separate faces, edges, and corners","methodDirectNodeIds":{"face-edge-corner-decomposition":["cnm_h107","cnm_p163","cnm_p161","cnm_p207","math:sphere-volume"]},"nodeIds":["cnm_h107","cnm_p163","cnm_p161","cnm_p207","math:sphere-volume"]}]},{"additionalConceptCount":4,"alignmentIds":["alignment:702b2a3bb468f15c556bce3b"],"answerCheck":{"derivedAnswer":"E, x=576","reason":"Positive edge lengths require x>1. Dividing abc=2(ab+ac+bc) by 2abc gives 1/2=1/a+1/b+1/c=log_x 2+log_x 3+log_x 4=log_x 24. Therefore √x=24, so x=576.","status":"matches"},"assessed":false,"bank":"amc","canonicalNodeIds":["cnm_p161"],"coverage":"aligned_concept_only","flags":[],"questionId":"2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Q09","reviewStatus":"machine_scope_audited","routes":[{"contextNodeIds":[],"id":"reciprocal-logarithms","label":"Reciprocal edge lengths","methodDirectNodeIds":{"reciprocal-logarithms":["cnm_p161","cnm_p163","cnm_h045","cnm_h044","cnm_h043"]},"nodeIds":["cnm_h045","cnm_h044","cnm_p161","cnm_p163","cnm_h043"]},{"contextNodeIds":["cnm_042","cnm_h048"],"id":"common-base-parameter","label":"Common-base parameter","methodDirectNodeIds":{"common-base-parameter":["cnm_p161","cnm_p163","cnm_h045","cnm_h044","cnm_h043"]},"nodeIds":["cnm_h045","cnm_042","cnm_h048","cnm_p161